      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LINDENOW BUSTER (4) has a strong overall record having 13 wins and seven places from 28 starts but was out of the money last time when sixth (26.44) over 460m at Warragul. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Looks the testing material here. CORBAN YAXLEY (3) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at his last five runs. Last start finished 3rd over 515m at this track beaten 8 lengths (29.68) behind Mepunga Turbo in a Mix 3/4 on September 17. Expecting another good run. PAW ORENTHAL (2) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.5 lengths at The Meadows in a handy 30.01 beating Big Boy Cooper. One of main contenders. PAW CARVER (8) took up a forward position and go the job done last time out. That form reads well.",
